        <!-- ================================================================
             NOTA: Las siguientes secciones han sido ELIMINADAS para Enterprise:
             - Accounting PDF Reports (OCA → usa informes nativos Enterprise)
             - OM Account Accountant (OCA → usa account_accountant Enterprise)
             - OM Account Asset (OCA → usa account_asset Enterprise)
             - OM Account Budget (OCA → usa account_budget Enterprise)
             - OM Account Daily Reports (OCA → sin equivalente directo)
             - OM Account Followup (OCA → usa account_followup Enterprise)
             - OM Fiscal Year (OCA → gestión nativa de años fiscales)
             - OM Recurring Payments (OCA → pagos recurrentes Enterprise)
             ================================================================ -->
